# Cursor Rules for MWAP Client (React + TypeScript)

## Purpose
- Establish world-class, enforceable rules for Cursor in this repository
- Optimize for correctness, security, type safety, and maintainability
- Ensure AI assistance aligns with our architecture, docs, and coding standards

## Do-First Principles
- Always read `DOCUMENTATION_INDEX.md` before implementing changes
- Prefer existing patterns in `src/features/*` and `src/shared/*`
- Keep changes minimal, focused, and type-safe
- Never modify `vite.config.ts` proxy configuration
- Never hardcode API URLs; always use the configured API client
- **IGNORE** all contents in `/docs/99-archive/` folder tree (deprecated/archived documentation)

## Documentation Map (nn-folders)
- Architecture: `docs/02-Architecture/README.md`
- Backend/API: `docs/04-Backend/README.md` (immutable; do not edit)
- Security: `docs/05-Security/README.md`
- Frontend/Features: `docs/03-Frontend/README.md`
- Guidelines: `docs/06-Guidelines/development-guide.md`
- Components: `docs/06-Guidelines/components.md`
